%FSLAX34Y34*%
%MOMM*%
G04 ================================================== *
G04 Macro Definition: Parameterized 3-Spoke (Segment)  *
G04                   Thermal Relief Pad               *
G04 Variables:                                         *
G04   $1 = Diameter                                    *
G04   $2 = Total Air Gap (start with 2mm)              *
G04   $3 = Spoke Angle Offset (start with 0 degrees)   *
G04 Parameters: D=2.00mm, TotalGap=2mm, Offset=0       *
G04 ================================================== *
%AMTHM_3SEG*
$4=$2/3*
$5=$1-0.01*
1,1,$1,0,0*
1,0,$5,0,0*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+1X360/3*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+2X360/3*
20,0,$4,0,0,0,$5,$3+3X360/3*%
G04 ================================================== *
G04 Map the macro with parameters (2.2mm, 2mm, 0 deg). *
G04 ================================================== *
%ADD10THM_3SEG,2.2X2X0*%
G04 ================================================== *
G04 Main Graphics Stream                               *
G04 ================================================== *
G04 Flash the default 2x2mm thermal                    *
D10*
X040000Y040000D03*
X080000Y080000D03*
M02*
